		(descr "Off-board buck wire-terminal landing (replaces on-board Pololu module). 2x XT30U-M vertical (keyed, mate from top) + 1x 0.1in 2-pin EN header. Pad map matches Conn_01x04 buck symbol so netlist is untouched: 1=VIN, 2=GND (x3, one per connector, all same net), 3=EN, 4=VOUT. Buck card lives in 3D-printed finned holder; crimp harness VBAT->VIN, VOUT->rail, EN->signal. XT30 P5.0mm drill 2.7; EN header 2.54mm drill 1.0. VERIFY XT30 + header geometry vs physical parts before fab.")
